   "date": "2022-11-15",
   "text": "Preventing Unnecessary Deaths During Life-Threatening Events Act\n This bill modifies the procedures for terminating electric service under the Public Utility Regulatory Policies Act of 1978; utilities may not terminate electricity during an extreme heat weather event or extreme cold weather event."
